  "description": "Animated pottery golems, fired in a mountain kiln town, duel on side-view stages. Four fighters, motion-input specials and supers, throws and techs, combos with damage scaling, an arcade ladder, local 2-player versus and a training room with frame data.",
  "controls": "P1: WASD or arrows move, J/K/L (or Z/X/C) light/medium/heavy, I or V throw (or light+medium). 2P versus: P1 WASD + J/K/L/I, P2 arrows + Num1/2/3/0 or , . / '. Pads: X/Y/RB light/medium/heavy, LB throw; P2 uses pad 2. P pause, M mute. Remap with the controls panel.",
